  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You let your allies know just what to say for others to learn from their experiences. Whenever a creature that shares your <em>rapport</em> attempts a skill check, another creature sharing the <em>rapport</em> within 30 feet can spend 1 use of skill leverage to verbally aid another as an immediate action before the recipient rolls their skill check if either of them have unlocked skill leverage with that skill.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/communication#toc40\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
